#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:1
msgid "ADR-0003: The `.lumos` document format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:3
msgid "**Status**: accepted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:4
msgid "**Date**: 2026-10-16"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:5
msgid "**Plan step**: P1.6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:7
msgid "Context"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:9
msgid ""
"Contexts, element groups and single elements must be exchanged between "
"the Python API, the web interface, the MCP server and users (REQ-EL-12, "
"REQ-CTX-8, §10 of the specs). Documents must be readable by humans, safe "
"to open (NF-7), and survive the evolution of LUMOS (versions, "
"migrations)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:13
msgid "Decision"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:15
msgid ""
"A `.lumos` file is a **UTF-8 strict-JSON** document (no `NaN`/`Infinity` "
"literals) with an envelope: `lumos_format` (`\"major.minor\"`, currently "
"`\"1.0\"`), `kind` (`\"element\"` now; `\"group\"` and `\"context\"` with"
" phase 5), `lumos_version` and `created_at` (UTC, ISO 8601)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:18
msgid ""
"A document of kind `element` holds one `element` entry: `type` (registry "
"identifier), `type_version`, `name`, `params`, `settings`, `state` and "
"`free` (free parameters and their priors)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:20
msgid ""
"**Quantities keep the user's unit** and use the encoding of "
"`lumos.units.quantity_to_json`; arrays are inline base64 with an allow-"
"list of dtypes. (Large arrays will move to a sidecar file in step P5.8.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:22
msgid ""
"Element classes are found in the **registry** from `type`; reading a "
"document never imports anything. The body is validated with the JSON "
"Schema of the class, then values are checked by the class itself (units, "
"bounds, shapes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:25
msgid "**Versions**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:26
msgid ""
"a newer `lumos_format` (major or minor) is refused with "
"`FormatVersionError`;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:27
msgid ""
"a newer `type_version` is refused; an older one is upgraded by the "
"migrations registered with `Registry.add_migration(type_id, "
"from_version)`, applied one version at a time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:29
msgid ""
"Every reading error is a `LumosFormatError` (a `ValueError`), except "
"unknown types (`UnknownTypeError`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:31
msgid "Alternatives considered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:33
msgid ""
"**YAML or TOML**: friendlier to edit by hand, but JSON is native to the "
"web interface and the MCP server, and its schema tooling is standard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:35
msgid ""
"**Pickle**: refused for security reasons (arbitrary code execution) and "
"because it is not portable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:36
msgid ""
"**Storing SI values only**: simpler, but users would lose their units "
"when reopening a file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:38
msgid "Consequences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:40
msgid ""
"Each change of the serialised form of an element class requires "
"incrementing its `type_version` and registering a migration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0003-lumos-format.md:42
msgid ""
"The document schema (envelope + element bodies) must be published in the "
"documentation (step P5.8)."
msgstr ""
